  "enable": false,
  "reason": "V6 (H-ELEM 14:20, +1 issue edge): inst/hgi_start/hgi_busy arrive at the issuer's d2 edge and are captured at this leaf's pins (= the d3 edge of the other children); tap_iteration/tap_steps are pin-captured by ot_hgi_coll_iter_mul, then 16x8 partial products, then a registered combine, so only field + offset adders sit between flops. VM read data moved to ot_hgi_coll_vmasm; vm_rv (valid bits) is captured at its pin. Every output is a flop Q. A synthesis pin stage would add edges the V6 schedule and lockstep bench (tb_hgi_coll_q_hard_v5 SH=4) do not carry."
 },
